; pictures' formats decoded: WebP, the web's own (Webp: the container;
; Vp8l: the lossless format; Vp8: the lossy one, a frame of the VP8
; video codec). The older formats (GIF, PNG, JPEG) are elm-playground's
; (tiny_libs.graphics_images); this one was born of the web and is
; told here. Pure OCaml, bytes in and pixels out.
(library
 (name mini_images)
 (wrapped false)
 (libraries
   tiny_libs.graphics_rgba ; Rgba_image: the pixels given back
   tiny_libs.compression)) ; Huffman: the lossless format's prefix codes
